    "prioritization": "The formally positive state-continuation effect is only 0.0206025 mm² and leaves ten pieces inactive, so another identical terminal restart is not prioritized as the next architecture even though no retrospective materiality gate is applied.",
    "nextExperiment": "Run a predefined predictive screen of exact free-space topology on matched sibling candidates before retention. Only if frontier-connected vacancy predicts fixed-horizon continuation success on held-out states should a later equal-work paired intervention test vacancy transport causally."
